title: >-
  Supplementary code and calibrated dataset for "Accessible Digital Twin
  Frameworks for Sustainable Traffic and Air Quality in 6G-Enabled Smart Cities"
message: >-
  If you use this software or dataset, please cite both the chapter and this
  software archive.
type: software
authors:
