version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-07-29"
keywords:
  - digital twin
  - traffic simulation
  - air quality
  - machine learning
  - 6G
  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for an accessible, open-source digital twin framework
  coupling microscopic traffic simulation, supervised machine learning and an
  emission-coupled dispersion model. All datasets are synthetic but calibrated to
  published Inner-London priors; they are not live measurements.
